      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "616235012c0de966b4e53cce",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I feel that the QM is placed too far to the left and weirdly angled to use comfortably. It would be nice to be able to reposition it to our liking.\nAn idea I had was to be able to drag it around like a browser tab from the top of the menu, possibly while in the Settings tab. \nThis would give the ability to rotate and position it comfortably while also being intuitive to do so.\nIt would also be a great way to look into implementing being able to place the menu into world space simply by dragging it off your hand.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1337] [Feebback] Ability to move quick menu along hand.",
